                  "subtitle": "Audited RAI Agent, Upstream Monitoring & Azure AI Infrastructure",
                  "content": "### 🛰️ Executive Enterprise AI Operations Center\n\nWelcome to the unified operations and financial governance dashboard for the **Foundry Responsible Agent Sentinel** and **Repo Watchdog Agent**.\n\n* **Azure AI Foundry Hub & Project:** Autonomous agent grounded in Azure AI Search with strict multi-point Responsible AI (RAI) prompt shields.\n* **Cognitive Compute:** GPT-4o orchestration with Text-Embedding-3-Large vectors.\n* **Perimeter Watchdog:** Rolling 24-hour upstream dependency telemetry and breaking-change detection.\n\n---\n#### ⚡ Quick Actions & Live Portals\n* 🌐 [Launch Live Tactical Watchdog UI](https://freefades2black.github.io/repo-watchdog-agent/)\n* 🧠 [Open Azure AI Foundry Studio](https://ai.azure.com/)\n* 🔍 [Open Azure AI Search Service](https://portal.azure.com/#blade/HubsExtension/BrowseResource/resourceType/Microsoft.Search%2FsearchServices)\n* 💰 [Open Azure Cost Management & Billing](https://portal.azure.com/#blade/Microsoft_Azure_CostManagement_Menu/CostAnalysis)"
